{"id":"obra","lemma":"obra","pos":"noun","rank":827,"glosses":["work (usually literary or artistic)","construction"],"ipa":"/ˈobɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"obras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-obra.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿A qué hora empieza la obra?","en":"What time does the play begin?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587423","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"hour"},{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Su jardín es una obra de arte.","en":"Her garden is a work of art.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568132","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"garden"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"art"}]},{"text":"Tendré que sacar una licencia de obras.","en":"I'll have to get a construction permit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/509078","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to put out, to get out"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"license"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Ella actuó en la obra.","en":"She acted in the play.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461489","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to act, to behave","l":"actuar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Esta obra es un musical.","en":"This play is a musical.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70079","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"musical"}]}]}